# Firebase config: android/app/google-services.json is committed so Android
# builds work out of the box. For iOS, add ios/GoogleService-Info.plist locally
# (see the README "Firebase" section) — it is intentionally not ignored so it
# can be committed alongside google-services.json if desired.

